/-!
# M14 periodic death-repair normalization

The two source-strict local economic deaths have different causes and require
different actual ordinary actions.  This module proves that the installed
health-service restoration and the installed remove-capture renewal factor
through one canonical ordinary economic normal form at the same literal root
next.

The normal form is indexed by both action-bearing receipts.  A full target
portfolio, an uncaptured target program, or a positive capacity readout cannot
construct it.  The public periodic producer accepts only `depth`; it accepts
no death, action, target, next, landing, rank, or U8 object.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false

namespace SaturationMonoid
namespace ProcessGame
namespace Society
namespace M14PeriodicDeathRepairNormalization

noncomputable section

